  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><color=#EF5350>[23:43] TV BROADCAST // EMERGENCY ALERT SYSTEM (CIVIL DANGER WARNING)</color></b>

    "This message is transmitted at the request of the King County Sheriff''s Office. This is not a test.


    A Civil Danger Warning is in effect for the Seattle metro area. Authorities are responding to rapidly spreading violent incidents and a suspected contagious illness. Avoid all physical contact.


    Shelter in place immediately. Major interstates are closed. Lock your doors, turn off lights, and stay inside. The National Guard is mobilizing. Lethal force is authorized."


    <color=#2C3E50>--------------------------------------------------------------------------</color>


    <b><color=#F5BF42>[23:44] REACTION // INNER MONOLOGUE</color></b>

    "Lethal force authorized... They don''t lock down the whole city over a normal riot. And this front door won''t stop a crowd if panic hits the hallway."


    <i>Through the wall, heavy footsteps run past in the corridor outside, followed by someone yelling and a fire door slamming shut.</i>


    <color=#2C3E50>--------------------------------------------------------------------------</color>


    <b><color=#4FC3F7>[23:45] APARTMENT 407 // LIVING ROOM</color></b>

    Blue and red lights sweep across your living room curtains from the street below. The front deadbolt is still locked. Your keys, wallet, and everyday gear are sitting on the coffee table.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 2113110389}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 249142832}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
